WEBVTT

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.740
Recruiter team of teenagers with attitudes.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:16.290
Oh, hi, boys.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:19.920
I look forward to a great show of talent.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:21.000
It's going to be awesome.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.500
This is a great idea, Mr. Kaplan.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:24.800
Thanks for thinking of it.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:32.080
How's rehearsal going?

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:36.740
It's going fine, except we're having a hard time keeping track of everybody's props.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.100
Yeah, we're still looking for a few things.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.860
Oh, no. Speaking of props, Jase, I forgot our belts.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.840
No, don't worry about it. We'll get our belts later.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:47.820
No, no, no. We have to have them. Look, I'll be right back.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:48.870
All right.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.240
All right. We'll wait for you here.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:01:59.390
Lovely. Dupendant.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:01.860
Uh-huh.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:03.160
Uh-huh.

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:04.100
Ah.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.820
Now, let's see.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.100
A few more fangs here and there.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:10.060
Perfect.

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:12.280
She'll be so surprised.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.870
It's the perfect birthday present for her illness.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:15.910
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:17.730
Oh, Andy.

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:18.610
Be well.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:36.180
Yeah, it's good to be on planet Earth.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.640
Power Rangers, I'm here.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.710
Mr. Kaplan, we were just, I was just looking for my guitar.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:08.430
Yeah, he likes to check his instruments before he performs.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.510
Oh, really? Well, fine, then.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.140
And you, Sco, what are you doing here?

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:20.540
My cymbals, Mr. C.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:28.790
Destroy! Destroy!

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:43.650
I know! I told Finster it's my birthday today!

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.880
He created it on his own and sends it as a surprise!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.320
Happy birthday!

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.560
Well, I'm sure it needs a hand!

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:52.760
So get down, Bulldog!

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.000
So evil one!

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.680
Right! To the park!

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:56.300
Ready!

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.370
That way is to be great.

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:09.170
Yes.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:18.240
Yes, my queen.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.380
Goldar and Fang are about to attack, but Tommy's there and he can ruin everything.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.620
What are you going to do about it, Finster?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:27.540
We wouldn't want him to do that.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.620
I shall send a putty patrol.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:21.480
You don't want to play, huh?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.740
I can use the practice before the show anyway.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.110
Give me the communicator back.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.940
Look, I'm done fooling around.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.610
Let me out of here.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.320
Buddy, come on.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:54.610
Wait, get out of here.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.380
Hey, I'm getting hungry.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:02.960
Quiet, you're always hungry.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.360
I'm a little peckish myself.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.910
Uh, look, there's some eggs.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.270
What are you fools doing?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:10.660
Get back here.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:15.120
Like me.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:21.930
Oh, delicious!

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.060
Tasty. Scrunches.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.840
Cut that down!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:38.220
He sounds kinda heavy, what's the matter?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:38.880
Hey!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.040
What do you mean?

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:44.910
Eat my Goonie bird eggs!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.080
You know how hard it is to find these?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.260
You can't just walk into a store and buy these, you know?

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:54.800
I was going to have these eggs for lunch!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:55.860
They were good!

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:57.300
Good?!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.920
I'm gonna tear you apart!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:22.880
i don't know he's not answering his communicator and he should have been back half an hour ago

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:27.210
yeah did you go to japan to pick up the black belts or what you know it's not funny you guys

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.920
i mean you could be in trouble affirmative i'm sure

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:46.670
something's wrong. We read you, Zordon. Teleport to the command center immediately. We're on our way.

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:55.770
Zordon, Tommy doesn't answer his communicator. That is why I have called you here. Observe the

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:59.790
viewing globe. He is being held hostage by Rita's party patrol.

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:02.960
Oh, no, Tommy. He's really in a bind.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.150
We gotta help him.

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:06.900
Not so fast, Zack. We have another problem.

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.540
Rita has released a gnarling Fang monster

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.680
who intends to destroy the Earth.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:14.270
Man, now he's ugly.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:17.580
Precisely. An absolutely atrocious beast.

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:20.710
But Zordon, shouldn't we help Tommy first?

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.750
He is capable of handling his situation.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:25.230
Your first priority must be to destroy Fang

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.230
before he can unleash his awesome power.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:28.520
It's morphin' time.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:47.400
Triceratops! Get some Goonie Bird Eggs!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.800
The Power Rangers have all the Goonie Bird Eggs!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.460
Attack and you can have them!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:52.120
Really?

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.800
Yeah! With Sprinkle Banner!

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:29.040
go get him bang

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:33.860
ATTEMPT!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:34.440
YEA!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.360
EXCITEMENTO MOONDUST!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:48.130
Hey, bang! You really know how to ROY!

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:05.870
Goldbear, you is splendiferous!

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:08.300
Hehehehehehe!

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:09.900
AHHHHH!

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:22.920
Get my goony bird eggs!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.200
They're gone!

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.380
Leave me alone!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.760
My goony bird eggs! They ate my goony bird eggs!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:36.520
What's so funny?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:37.000
Ha!

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.880
Do as I command and you shall have your eggs!

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.470
Do you promise to obey?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:42.130
Oh!

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:43.350
Watch this!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:48.680
My eggs!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:49.500
Ha ha!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:10:59.800
Anything!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:00.330
Stay!

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:19.550
Better stop this thing before he does some real damage

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:24.100
I want the map

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:29.200
We don't have any eggs

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:29.980
Read a lot

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:34.520
to you. You don't stop fighting. We're gonna have to make you stop. Got it?

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:36.100
I'm gonna get you!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.830
Alright, let's finish him, guys!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:54.240
Alright, Rangers. Let's get it together. This lizard's not going down easy.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.220
We've gotta give it all we've got!

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.020
Give me the eggs, now!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:18.960
Please help!

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.850
We are victorious!

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:15.040
I'm right here, buddy.

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:16.210
Where are you guys?

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:17.650
The Angel Grove Dam.

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:18.610
We need your help.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:19.050
Hurry!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.240
I'm on my way.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:21.640
Dragon Sword!

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:22.910
All right!

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:01.350
Oh,

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.620
Good news, Zordon. We destroyed Rita's plans again.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:45.920
Yeah, it was more phenomenal.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.500
Congratulations, Power Rangers, on a job well done.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:50.200
Hey!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.380
Where have you guys been?

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:53.440
You're up next!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.050
Rock the house, fellas.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.980
Okay, next up, we got...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.760
Tommy and Chasen. So let's give him a big hand, huh?

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:30.570
Oh

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.060
Ha, ha, ha.
